# What must never reach the image.
#
# The build stage does `COPY . .`, and this checkout has more in it than the
# app: the deployment repo, the private notes, the marketing site, the fleet.
# Without this file every one of them is baked into a layer of an image that is
# then pushed to a public registry — where a deleted file in a later layer is
# still readable in the earlier one. This is the file that stops that.
#
# Everything here is either private, enormous, or rebuilt inside the image
# anyway.

# The private siblings. Ignored in .gitignore too; a published image is a
# second way for them to leave the machine.
/ontoplano-server/
/ontoplano-site/
/ontoplano-development/
/ontoplano-marketing/
/vboxes/
/temp/
/notes/
TO-REVIEW.md

# Secrets and local state.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
/android-twa/android.keystore
/android-twa/android.keystore.pass

# Rebuilt in the image, or irrelevant to it.
node_modules
/build
/build-docs
/.svelte-kit
/coverage
/test-results
/playwright-report
/android
/android-twa
/e2e
/tests
/.git
/.github
/.claude
/.claude-docker
/.opencode
/.vscode
